{"ordinal":12834,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453168242707","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Death_076eba6","source":"Marauder: К паскуде такой…","target":"Marauder: La ticălosul ăla…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-322.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12835,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453168242706","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Death_06a7eff","source":"Marauder: Не стоило всё же заходить сюда…","target":"Marauder: Totuși, n-ar fi trebuit să intru aici…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-322.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12836,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453168242705","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Ears_DontShoot_0dceab2","source":"Marauder: Когда один идёшь – начинаешь слышать всякое. Скрипы, шёпот, будто кто-то зовёт. Оглядываешься – никого. Но всё равно прислушиваешься… мало ли.","target":"Marauder: Când mergi singur, începi să auzi tot felul de lucruri. Scârțâituri, șoapte, parcă te strigă cineva. Te uiți în jur — nimeni. Dar tot ciulești urechile… nu se știe niciodată.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-322.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12837,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453168242704","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Photo_DontShoot_0664701","source":"Marauder: Смотрел, гадал – кто из них выжил? Может, хоть один? Или их портрет – всё, что осталось?","target":"Marauder: M-am uitat și m-am întrebat: care dintre ei o fi supraviețuit? Măcar unul? Sau portretul lor e tot ce-a rămas?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-322.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12838,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453168242703","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Photo_DontShoot_09d4b1b","source":"Marauder: Помню, нашёл старую фотографию в одном доме. Семья, двое детей, муж с женой – все улыбаются.","target":"Marauder: Îmi amintesc că am găsit o fotografie veche într-o casă. O familie, doi copii, soț și soție — toți zâmbeau.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-322.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12839,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453168242702","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Armpit_DontShoot_092cf75","source":"Marauder: Я терпел всю свою жизнь. И ещё потерплю. А денежка всегда понадобится.","target":"Marauder: Am îndurat toată viața. Mai pot îndura puțin. Și banii sunt întotdeauna buni.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-322.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12840,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453168242701","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Armpit_DontShoot_0d13370","source":"Marauder: А мне-то что? Ну, поболит, почешется денёк-два. Я стерплю. Мне не впервые.","target":"Marauder: Și ce-mi pasă? Mă doare, mă mănâncă o zi sau două. Suport. Nu e prima oară.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-322.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12841,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453168242700","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Eyes_DontShoot_0dc440f","source":"Marauder: А теперь ему либо хреново без очков-то, либо он вообще ничего не видит…","target":"Marauder: Iar acum, ori îi e al naibii de greu fără ochelari, ori nu mai vede nimic…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-322.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12842,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453168242699","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Eyes_DontShoot_095f150","source":"Marauder: Снял их, посмотрел на линзы – а на них отпечатки пальцев остались. Всё представлял, как этот ребёнок их носил, как смотрел на мир…","target":"Marauder: I-am luat, m-am uitat la lentile și am văzut urme de degete pe ele. Mă tot gândeam cum îi purta copilul acela, cum vedea lumea…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-322.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12843,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453168242698","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Eyes_DontShoot_0402bd1","source":"Marauder: Вспомнил историю, кстати. Нашёл в очередном доме на столе детские очки, маленькие такие.","target":"Marauder: Apropo, mi-am amintit o întâmplare. Am găsit pe masa unei alte case niște ochelari de copil, micuți.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-322.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12844,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453168242697","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Eyes_DontShoot_0be844e","source":"Marauder: Так-то лучше.","target":"Marauder: Așa e mai bine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-322.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12845,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453168242696","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Hands_DontShoot_0214484","source":"Marauder: Что меня реально волнует… лежат ли они до сих пор там, часики-то?","target":"Marauder: Ce mă frământă cu adevărat… ceasul ăla mai e acolo oare?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-322.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12846,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453168242695","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Hands_DontShoot_0c19c6b","source":"Marauder: Я чего-то испугался знатно и сразу дёрнул оттуда. Был ли там кто-то в действительности или нет – мне не очень интересно.","target":"Marauder: M-am speriat zdravăn și am șters-o imediat de-acolo. Dacă era cineva acolo sau nu, nici nu mă interesează.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-322.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12847,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453168242694","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Hands_DontShoot_0e84a67","source":"Marauder: Взял с полки карманные часы, старинные такие. Думаю, редкость, авось хорошо продам. А потом слышу – шаги наверху.","target":"Marauder: Am luat de pe raft un ceas de buzunar, din acela vechi. Mi-am zis că e rar, poate-l vând bine. Și apoi aud pași la etaj.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-322.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12848,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453168242693","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Hands_DontShoot_018d6aa","source":"Marauder: Помню, нашёл один дом. Вроде как полностью пустой.","target":"Marauder: Îmi amintesc că am găsit o casă. Părea complet pustie.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-322.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12849,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453168242692","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Teeth_DontShoot_06410a5","source":"Marauder: А потом ему голову оторвало. Зубы – последнее, о чём он думал в тот момент. Наверное… Я так-то не знаю, что он думал, хм…","target":"Marauder: Și apoi i-a zburat capul. Dinții erau ultimul lucru la care se gândea atunci. Probabil… De fapt, nu știu la ce se gândea, hm…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-322.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12850,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453168242691","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Teeth_DontShoot_0584817","source":"Marauder: Был у меня когда-то знакомый. Всё переживал, что пломба выпала.","target":"Marauder: Aveam cândva un cunoscut. Se tot frământa că îi căzuse o plombă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-322.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12851,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453168242690","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Ears_Gun_0eff81b","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12852,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453168242689","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Ears_Gun_0126317","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12853,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453168242688","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Ears_Gun_03cebae","source":"Marauder: Ухо не понравилось, что ли?!","target":"Marauder: Nu ți-a plăcut urechea mea, sau ce?!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12854,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453164048393","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Photo_Gun_01c1cae","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12855,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453164048392","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Photo_Gun_0e06a06","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12856,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453164048391","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Photo_Gun_0b6d961","source":"Marauder: Хотя бы терпеть дальше не придётся.","target":"Marauder: Măcar n-o să mai trebuiască să îndur.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12857,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453164048390","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Photo_Gun_0814d4b","source":"Marauder: Если ты мне приговор по фото вынес – чё тянуть? Давай уж.","target":"Marauder: Dacă mi-ai dat verdictul după fotografie, de ce mai tragi de timp? Hai odată.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12858,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453164048389","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Armpit_Gun_0e3bbe1","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12859,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453164048388","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Armpit_Gun_07d6ca5","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12860,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453164048387","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Armpit_Gun_03a6fda","source":"Marauder: Слушай, даже если бы я нашёл мазь какую-то от этого, всё равно не мазал бы, а продал.","target":"Marauder: Ascultă, chiar dacă aș găsi vreun unguent pentru asta, tot nu m-aș da cu el. L-aș vinde.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12861,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453164048386","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Eyes_Gun_0ed24ff","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12862,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453164048385","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Eyes_Gun_0edc918","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12863,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453164048384","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Eyes_Gun_0d0ecdd","source":"Marauder: Ну и что тебе не понравилось? Может, обсудим ситуацию как цивилизованные люди?","target":"Marauder: Ei, ce nu ți-a plăcut? Poate discutăm situația ca niște oameni civilizați?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12864,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453159854087","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Hands_Gun_07f74dc","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12865,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453159854086","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Hands_Gun_009c723","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12866,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453159854085","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Hands_Gun_0ca4bd7","source":"Marauder: Вот уж ирония: убить мародёра, потому что он брал то, что уже никому не нужно. Ха-ха.","target":"Marauder: Ce ironie: să omori un jefuitor fiindcă a luat lucruri de care nimeni nu mai avea nevoie. Ha-ha.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12867,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453159854084","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Teeth_Gun_0add78f","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12868,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453159854083","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Teeth_Gun_0a4af3b","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12869,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453159854082","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Teeth_Gun_0423580","source":"Marauder: Ну, если жить с плохими зубами нельзя – стреляй. Я и не знал, что теперь мир так работает.","target":"Marauder: Ei, dacă nu ai voie să trăiești cu dinți stricați, trage. Nu știam că așa merge lumea acum.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12870,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453159854081","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Ears_0129390","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12871,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453159854080","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Ears_07873b8","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12872,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453155659781","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Ears_07ac379","source":"Marauder: Удостоверился?","target":"Marauder: Te-ai convins?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12873,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453155659780","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Ears_0af3353","source":"Marauder: ...","target":"Marauder: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12874,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453155659779","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Ears_0b16ef8","source":"Marauder: Не порванное, не обкусанное, как у бродячих. Самое обычное ухо.","target":"Marauder: Nici ruptă, nici mușcată ca la animalele fără stăpân. O ureche cât se poate de obișnuită.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12875,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453155659778","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Photo_0a9bbde","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12876,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453155659777","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Photo_0993581","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12877,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453155659776","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Photo_0971959","source":"Marauder: Неужели твоя машинка разглядит, что во мне на самом деле?","target":"Marauder: Oare aparatul tău poate vedea ce-i în mine cu adevărat?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12878,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453151465480","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Photo_015012e","source":"Marauder: ...","target":"Marauder: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12879,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453151465479","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Photo_0046e8d","source":"Marauder: Ну ладно. Твой дом – твои правила…","target":"Marauder: Bine, fie. Casa ta, regulile tale…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12880,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453151465478","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Photo_0bd0bdc","source":"Marauder: Да брось ты. Зачем оно?","target":"Marauder: Hai, las-o baltă. La ce-ți trebuie?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12881,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453151465477","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Armpit_0ed5839","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12882,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453151465476","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Armpit_0272ca0","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12883,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453151465475","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Armpit_0a2d59b","source":"Marauder: Раздражение есть, да. Побаливает. Но что в этих условиях поделаешь-то?","target":"Marauder: Da, am o iritație. Mă mai și doare. Dar ce poți face în condițiile astea?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12884,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453151465474","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Armpit_09e7352","source":"Marauder: ...","target":"Marauder: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12885,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453151465473","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Armpit_0ddeac0","source":"Marauder: Мда, и это мне не удавалось ужиться с людьми…","target":"Marauder: Mda, și cică eu nu mă puteam înțelege cu oamenii…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12886,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453151465472","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Eyes_0b4b71f","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12887,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453147271173","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Eyes_02fd269","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12888,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453147271172","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Eyes_0036599","source":"Marauder: Ничего особенного, видишь?","target":"Marauder: Nimic neobișnuit, vezi?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12889,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453147271171","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Eyes_06cca3c","source":"Marauder: ...","target":"Marauder: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12890,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453147271170","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Eyes_03d53bb","source":"Marauder: Да обычные у меня глаза.","target":"Marauder: Am ochi obișnuiți.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12891,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453147271169","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Hands_080e86a","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12892,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453147271168","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Hands_0892db9","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12893,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453143076871","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Hands_0412f37","source":"Marauder: А ничего из этого мне теперь не принадлежит. Может, оно и хорошо. Зато выжил.","target":"Marauder: Și nimic din toate astea nu-mi mai aparține acum. Poate-i mai bine așa. Măcar am supraviețuit.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12894,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453143076870","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Hands_093dafb","source":"Marauder: Но знаешь, что смешно? Эти пальцы столько добра потрогали, столько ценных вещей через них прошло…","target":"Marauder: Dar știi ce-i amuzant? Degetele astea au atins atâtea bunuri, le-au trecut prin mână atâtea lucruri de preț…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12895,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453143076869","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Hands_0519759","source":"Marauder: Ногти не первой свежести. Мда…","target":"Marauder: Unghiile nu-s prea curate. Mda…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12896,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453143076868","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Hands_0db4463","source":"Marauder: Ногти не первой свежести. Не вижу смысла чистить, если я их опять замараю.","target":"Marauder: Unghiile nu-s prea curate. Nu văd rostul să le curăț dacă tot o să le murdăresc iar.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12897,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453143076867","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Hands_095bc14","source":"Marauder: ...","target":"Marauder: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12898,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453143076866","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Hands_02f154d","source":"Marauder: Ладошки, ладошечки.","target":"Marauder: Palmele, pălmuțele.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12899,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453143076865","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Teeth_0405148","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12900,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453143076864","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Teeth_04fe74b","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12901,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453138882568","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Teeth_099b83c","source":"Marauder: Да и смысл, если всё равно от меня шарахаются? Я уж лучше эту лишнюю бутылку воды выпью, чем её на это тратить.","target":"Marauder: Și la ce bun, dacă lumea tot se ferește de mine? Mai bine beau eu sticla aia de apă în plus decât s-o irosesc pe asta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12902,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453138882567","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Teeth_03c5fe5","source":"Marauder: Ну чего ты так кривишься? Ну да. Не чистил, не чищу, и не буду их чистить. Моё право.","target":"Marauder: Ce strâmbi așa din nas? Da, nu i-am periat, nu-i periez și nici n-o să-i periez. E dreptul meu.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12903,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453138882566","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Teeth_056d150","source":"Marauder: ...","target":"Marauder: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12904,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453138882565","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_Teeth_099b960","source":"Marauder: Я однажды видел такие зубы. А, ну, да. Сначала свои показать, а потом уже история.","target":"Marauder: Am văzut odată niște dinți ca ăștia. Ah, da. Mai întâi să ți-i arăt pe ai mei, apoi îți povestesc.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
