{"ordinal":12910,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453134688265","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_WannaCheck_00a7b04","source":"Зубы","target":"Dinți","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12911,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453134688264","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Marauder_WannaCheck_0eaeb16","source":"Marauder: Ох, ну давай, чего уж там. Всё равно уже не привыкать, что меня во всём подозревают.","target":"Marauder: Of, hai, dacă tot suntem aici. Sunt deja obișnuit să fiu bănuit de toate.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-323.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
